<rml>
<head>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="theme.rcss"/>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="messages.rcss"/>
</head>
<body data-model="messages">
    <!-- §8.1 gate-blocker backlog: the full message-LOG screen
         (Messages::display_messages, the ESC log). A scrolling text pane, one
         row per folded message line: a right-aligned time column (shown only
         when the time string changes, light-blue) + the message text coloured
         by msgtype (cata_text_to_rml of colorize(...)). The curses ASCII
         time-range bracket glyphs (LINE_XOXO/XXOO/OXXO) are DROPPED — semantic
         rewrite keeps the time grouping (blank-vs-shown time column) not the
         line art (cf. diary's book border). Native RmlUi scroll replaces the
         curses offset windowing; UP/DOWN/PAGE_UP/PAGE_DOWN scroll the pane.
         The transient FILTER input + help overlay is NOT in this doc — it is a
         string_input_popup (Tier-0) that composites on top, like diary's nested
         editor. -->
    <div class="panel msg-panel">
        <div id="msg-screen" class="msg-screen scroll-pane">
            <div class="msg-line" data-for="r : rows">
                <span class="msg-time" data-rml="r.time_rml"></span>
                <span class="msg-text" data-rml="r.text_rml"></span>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="msg-footer" data-rml="footer_rml"></div>
    </div>
</body>
</rml>
